<text><![CDATA[Jupiter is the fifth planet from the Sun. Jupiter is the largest planet in the solar system.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Jupiter is also the stormiest planet in the solar system.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[The red spot in the middle of Jupiter is a large storm that has been active for hundreds of years.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Length of day: </B><br>9 hours, 55 minutes]]></text>
